:83,"_41":37,"_42":37,"_43":44,"_45":84,"_47":85,"_49":86,"_51":87,"_53":-5,"_54":88,"_56":89,"_58":90,"_60":91,"_62":37,"_63":64},{"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":29,"_30":31,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":37,"_39":40,"_41":37,"_42":37,"_43":44,"_45":46,"_47":48,"_49":50,"_51":52,"_53":-5,"_54":55,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":61,"_62":37,"_63":64},"id","1768","name","Ibn Battuta","type","person","startDescription","A renowned explorer and traveler, known for his extensive journeys across the Islamic world and beyond.","endDescription","His travel accounts provide valuable insights into the cultures and societies of his time.","startYear",1304,"startMonth",0,"startDay","endYear",1369,"endMonth","endDay","startSignificance",0.8,"endSignificance",0.6,"imageUrl","https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Handmade_oil_painting_reproduction_of_Ibn_Battuta_in_Egypt%2C_a_painting_by_Hippolyte_Leon_Benett..jpg/330px-Handmade_oil_painting_reproduction_of_Ibn_Battuta_in_Egypt%2C_a_painting_by_Hippolyte_Leon_Benett..jpg","imageCredit","Image: Ibn Battuta / Wikimedia Commons","sourceUrl","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ibn_Battuta","cdnId","country",{"_26":74,"_75":76},"subjects",[71],"group",{"_26":68,"_69":70},"user",{"_24":65,"_66":67},"likes","liked",false,"6","username","HistOracle","Silk Road","icon","GiCaravan",{"_24":72,"_26":73},"3","culture","Morocco","continent","Africa","2080","Decline of the Silk Road","event","The decline of a major trade route that connected the East and West, facilitating the exchange of goods, culture, and ideas.","The route gradually lost its significance due to maritime trade routes becoming more dominant and political instability in the region.",1300,1600,0.9,"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Silk_road_Kazakhstan.svg/330px-Silk_road_Kazakhstan.svg.png","Image: Silk Road / Wikimedia Commons","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silk_Road#Decline",{"_26":98,"_75":98},[92,93],{"_26":68,"_69":70},{"_24":65,"_66":67},{"_24":96,"_26":97},{"_24":94,"_26":95},"8","economic","2","politics","Global","643","The Travels of Marco Polo","This travelogue recounts the adventures of a Venetian merchant in Asia, detailing the cultures, economies, and landscapes encountered during his journeys.","Its impact on European perceptions of Asia and trade routes was profound, influencing exploration and commerce for centuries.",1295,1,"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Marco_Polo_-_Battle_of_the_King_of_Burma_against_the_Mongols.jpg/330px-Marco_Polo_-_Battle_of_the_King_of_Burma_against_the_Mongols.jpg","Unknown author / Wikimedia Commons / Public domain","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Travels_of_Marco_Polo","images/44e0b27aa5c3f0516d8e4aefc4d968ed2f345cbf.webp",{"_26":116,"_75":117},[113,114],{"_26":68,"_69":70},{"_24":65,"_66":67},{"_24":72,"_26":73},{"_24":65,"_26":115},"maritime","Italy","Europe","2081","Pax Mongolica","period","This period marked a time of peace and stability across the vast Mongol Empire, facilitating trade and cultural exchange along the Silk Road.","The era concluded with the fall of the Yuan dynasty, leading to the fragmentation of Mongol control and a decline in trade security.",1206,1368,"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Caravane_Marco_Polo.jpg/330px-Caravane_Marco_Polo.jpg","Image: Pax Mongolica / Wikimedia Commons","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pax_Mongolica",{"_26":134,"_75":135},[132,133],{"_26":68,"_69":70},{"_24":65,"_66":67},{"_24":72,"_26":73},{"_24":94,"_26":95},"Mongolia","Asia","2089","Xuanzang's Journey to India","An influential pilgrimage undertaken by a monk, aiming to acquire sacred texts and deepen understanding of Buddhism.","The journey concluded with the monk returning to his homeland, bringing back valuable scriptures and knowledge that enriched local practices.",629,645,"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Xuanzang_w.jpg/330px-Xuanzang_w.jpg","Image: Xuanzang / Wikimedia Commons","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xuanzang",{"_26":155,"_75":135},[149,150],{"_26":68,"_69":70},{"_24":65,"_66":67},{"_24":153,"_26":154},{"_24":151,"_26":152},"7","religion","4","intellectual","China","2077","The Spread of Islam","Islam spread rapidly along the Silk Road, influencing trade, culture, and politics across Asia and beyond.","By this time, Islam had established itself as a major world religion, impacting various societies along the routes.",600,1500,0.7,"","Image: Spread of Islam / Wikimedia Commons","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spread_of_Islam",{"_26":98,"_75":98},[170,171],{"_26":68,"_69":70},{"_24":65,"_66":67},{"_24":72,"_26":73},{"_24":151,"_26":152},"2076","The Sogdian Merchants","These traders played a crucial role in the Silk Road economy, facilitating trade between various cultures and regions.","Their influence waned as political changes altered trade dynamics, but their legacy in commerce endures.",200,1000,0.4,"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Map_of_Sogdia.png/330px-Map_of_Sogdia.png","Image: Sogdia / Wikimedia Commons","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sogdian_people",{"_26":189,"_75":135},[187,188],{"_26":68,"_69":70},{"_24":151,"_66":186},"Kushim",{"_24":72,"_26":73},{"_24":94,"_26":95},"Uzbekistan","67","landmark","The Silk Road was a network of trade routes connecting the East and West, facilitating cultural, commercial, and technological exchange.","The routes fell into decline with the rise of maritime trade routes, altering global trade dynamics.",130,1453,"Kelvin Case / Turkish Flame / SmallJarsWithGreenLabels / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 4.0","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silk_Road","images/62942c1027b1fb9c341a8594160c1f9cfee13b6a.webp",{"_26":98,"_75":98},[203],{"_26":68,"_69":70},{"_24":65,"_66":67},{"_24":72,"_26":73},"2079","Han–Xiongnu Wars","A series of military conflicts between the Han dynasty and the Xiongnu confederation, marking a significant struggle for dominance in Central Asia.","The wars concluded with the Han dynasty establishing a more secure border and reducing the threat posed by the Xiongnu, leading to a period of relative peace.",-200,-89,"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/ZhangQianTravels.jpg/330px-ZhangQianTravels.jpg","Image: Han–Xiongnu Wars / Wikimedia Commons","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Han%E2%80%93Xiongnu_Wars",{"_26":155,"_75":135},[217],{"_26":68,"_69":70},{"_24":65,"_66":67},{"_24":218,"_26":219},"1","military",[],"subject",[],[],"yearStart",-300000,"yearEnd",2025,"search","sortBy",true,33]
